  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A small sphere is rising vertically upwards in a liquid at constant speed. The weight of the sphere is three times the viscous drag force that acts on the sphere. What is the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textup{density of liquid}}{\\textup{density of sphere}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{3}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
